  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZBuVHSW3Du\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><em>加入Discord，獲取更新預告並參與社群討論！</em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">必要依賴：GeckoLib 與 PlayerAnimator<span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br></span></span> </span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">強烈建議安裝</span></span>：EpicFight&nbsp;</span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">《魔物獵人》所有版權均屬CAPCOM所有！</span></strong></em></span></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1420/954/d1b1166cf78dbd540c59595b284b5ea2937ae9ecda39a3ee5e.png\" alt=\"模組標語\" width=\"1905\" height=\"80\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1421/169/untitled125_20251211150207.png\" alt=\"模組橫幅\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《魔物獵人：天堂與地獄》是一款將《魔物獵人》系列的核心元素融入Minecraft的模組，並以其獨特的創新與世界觀呈現，帶給玩家完整的狩獵體驗！</span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1420/948/m3h4.png\" alt=\"旅程的起點\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></em></span></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">扮演一名從最底層開始的獵人，透過保護弱者、驅逐遠古野獸，一步步踏上巔峰！</span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1420/949/m3h5.png\" alt=\"是與魔物成為夥伴…還是擊退牠們？\" width=\"1905\" height=\"1072\"></em></span></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>你會遇到各式各樣的生物，是與牠們結交、還是…隨你決定！但有些生物遠非友情所能馴服…你該如何抉擇？</strong></span></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1420/950/m3h3.png\" alt=\"勢不可擋的力量\" width=\"1905\" height=\"1072\"></span></span></span></em></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">在任務中對抗日益強大的敵人，不斷強化自身，探索各地，成為最頂尖的獵人！</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1420/952/m3h2.png\" alt=\"搖滾起來！\" width=\"1905\" height=\"1072\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>隨著模組作曲家創作的精彩主題曲，在遊戲中盡情搖滾！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>勇敢的獵人，你能否將自己的名字刻入傳說之中？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
